# The Puppet Master (windurst 81): the completed line's reply kind at Koru-Moru (Windurst Walls). Completed by GM, Class
# Reunion not completed, the quest's mustZone set by GM, Carbuncle Debacle accepted with CarbuncleDebacleProgress 2
# (GMs: Koru-Moru's script answers 416; accepted since 416 wants it so, user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs): 405
# (Event) alternates with his script's 416 (405, 416, 405); a Progress 405 would play on every talk.
lists WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-120.2,-5.5,122.4 job=SMN lvl=40
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster completed
quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 2
login
charvar Quest[2][81]mustZone 239               # GM
trigger Koru-Moru                              # completed, the mustZone: 405 (Event: the quest's turn)
finish
trigger Koru-Moru                              # his script's turn: 416
finish
trigger Koru-Moru                              # 405 again
finish
